5,0,1,talk,Midori,,"Hello everyone. I'm glad we can all work together. Since we have a Werewolf and a Possessed among us, let's try to stay calm and communicate openly to find the truth. I'm looking forward to getting to know you.","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Rin,,"Hi Midori! I'm so excited to play! I bet I can sniff out the werewolf with my super-intuition! Let's all talk a lot so we can figure out who's acting weird, okay? This is going to be a big adventure!","{""words"":40,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Sakura,,"Yay! A big adventure! I want to help too! I'll use my super-duper detective skills to find the bad wolf! Hehe, I wonder who's hiding a secret? This is going to be so much fun!","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Shion,,"Intuition and ""detective skills"" are hardly reliable tools. Let's focus on logical consistency and speech patterns instead. If we want to win, we need a systematic approach, not just excitement.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Benjamin,,"I must agree with Shion. While enthusiasm is charming, logic is our only reliable compass here. Let us observe how each person handles the pressure of the coming days; inconsistencies often reveal the hidden hand.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Midori,,"I agree with Shion and Benjamin that logic is important, but let's not forget that how we treat each other matters too. If we stay supportive, it might be easier for the truth to surface naturally.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Shion"",""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Rin,,"@Shion @Benjamin You're both so serious! But sometimes the ""weird"" feeling is the most important clue! If we only use logic, the wolf might just trick us with fancy words. Let's trust our guts too!","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Shion"",""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Sakura,,@Rin is right! Fancy words can be like a magic trick to hide the wolf! I'm going to keep a super close eye on everyone. Maybe the wolf is already nervous? Hehe!,"{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Shion,,"@Rin @Sakura ""Guts"" are just patterns your brain hasn't consciously processed yet. If you find someone ""weird,"" explain exactly why. Vague feelings are useless; specific contradictions are what will actually catch the wolf.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Rin"",""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Shion, a precise point. @Rin, @Sakura, while your intuition may serve as a catalyst, it requires evidence to be actionable. Let us strive to translate those ""feelings"" into observable behaviors we can all analyze.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Shion"",""Rin"",""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Midori,,"It seems we have two different perspectives on how to approach this. Perhaps we can combine them? We can listen to those intuitive feelings, but then use Shion and Benjamin's logic to verify them.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Shion"",""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Rin,,"That's a great idea, Midori! We can be a super-team! I'll find the ""weird"" things, and then Shion and Benjamin can use their big brains to prove it! Who wants to go first and tell us something?","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Midori"",""Shion"",""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Sakura,,I'll be the one to watch for the funny faces! Hehe! If someone looks like they're hiding a yummy snack—or a big secret—I'll let everyone know right away! Who's the most suspicious so far?,"{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Shion,,"It's too early to name a suspect. However, the eagerness of Rin and Sakura to ""find"" the wolf could be a mask for the Possessed, attempting to steer the conversation. I'll be watching your patterns closely.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Rin"",""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Benjamin,,"@Shion, a prudent observation. Over-eagerness can indeed be a calculated performance to deflect suspicion. For now, let us simply observe. I am curious to see who will be the first to claim a role tomorrow.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Midori,,"Let's keep a positive atmosphere for now. Since we've agreed on a balanced approach, let's all try to be mindful of each other's words. I hope we can all sleep peacefully tonight. Good luck, everyone.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,0,4,talk,Rin,,"I'll sleep tight! But I'll be dreaming of clues! @Shion, don't be too grumpy, okay? We're all friends here... unless you're the wolf! Hehe, just kidding! See you all tomorrow morning!","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
22,0,4,pass,Rin,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
23,0,4,talk,Sakura,,"I'll dream of clues too! @Shion, you're so scary when you're serious, but I'm not scared of you! Hehe! Goodnight everyone, sleep tight and don't let the wolf bite!","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over!""}]}"
24,0,4,pass,Sakura,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
25,0,4,talk,Shion,,"@Rin @Sakura Your attempts at humor are noted, but they don't change the facts. I'll be analyzing every word spoken tomorrow to see who slips up. Goodnight.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Rin"",""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
26,0,4,pass,Shion,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
27,0,4,talk,Benjamin,,"A fitting conclusion to our first day. Let us hope the night provides the Seer with a clarity that our current enthusiasm lacks. Sleep well, everyone; I shall be awaiting tomorrow's revelations with great interest.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
28,0,4,pass,Benjamin,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
