68,2,1,talk,Rin,,"Oh no! Midori is gone! That's so scary! The wolf really did attack the Seer! @Shion, @Sakura, are you guys okay? This is getting way too serious! Who could have been so mean to Midori?","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Midori"",""Shion"",""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,2,1,talk,Sakura,,I'm not okay! I'm super sad! *Sniff* Midori was so nice and helpful! The wolf is a big meanie for taking her away! Who could do such a thing? I'm actually a little bit scared now!,"{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,2,1,talk,Shion,,"@Rin @Sakura Stop the emotional outbursts. Midori's death confirms she was likely the Seer, as the wolf would prioritize removing the only source of concrete information. We are now left with the three of us. One is the wolf.","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Rin"",""Sakura"",""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,2,2,talk,Rin,,"@Shion, you're always so cold! But you're right, the wolf was super sneaky to take Midori. Since Benjamin is gone and Midori is gone, it's just us! @Sakura, do you think the wolf is pretending to be sad?","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Shion"",""Midori"",""Benjamin"",""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,2,2,talk,Sakura,,"@Rin, that's a scary thought! I hope not! I'm really sad, and I bet the wolf is just pretending to be a good person to trick us! Hehe... wait, that's not funny! I'm really scared! @Shion, help us find the meanie!","{""words"":41,""mentions"":[""Rin"",""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,2,2,talk,Shion,,"@Rin @Sakura Your fear is a distraction. Let's look at the facts: Benjamin was executed, and Midori was killed. If Benjamin were the wolf, the wolf would be gone. Since the game continues, Benjamin was human. Therefore, the wolf is one of you.","{""words"":43,""mentions"":[""Rin"",""Sakura"",""Benjamin"",""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,2,3,talk,Rin,,"@Shion, that's not fair! You're just guessing! I've been trying to help the whole time! @Sakura, Shion is being a big meanie again! Do you think he's just trying to trick us into blaming each other?","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Shion"",""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
75,2,3,talk,Sakura,,"@Shion is being super scary again! *Hmph!* He's just pointing fingers because he's the smart one! Maybe he's using his big brain to make us look like the bad guys! @Rin, I'm scared he's trying to trick us!","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Shion"",""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
76,2,3,talk,Shion,,"@Rin @Sakura Your sudden shift to emotional appeals and mutual defense is a classic sign of desperation. Logic dictates that since Benjamin was not the wolf, the wolf must be among the survivors. Your attempts to paint me as a ""meanie"" are irrelevant.","{""words"":43,""mentions"":[""Rin"",""Sakura"",""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
77,2,4,talk,Rin,,"@Shion, you're just using big words to make us feel small! @Sakura, I think Shion is just trying to act all logical so we don't notice he's the wolf! He's too mean to be a good guy! Let's vote for him!","{""words"":41,""mentions"":[""Shion"",""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
78,2,4,talk,Sakura,,I agree with @Rin! @Shion is just trying to bully us into being scared! He's acting like a big boss to hide his wolfy tail! Hehe! Let's get the meanie wolf! I vote for Shion!,"{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Rin"",""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
79,2,4,talk,Shion,,"@Rin @Sakura Your logic is nonexistent. You're simply reacting to my personality rather than the facts. If you execute me, a human, the wolf wins instantly. I am the only one here thinking clearly. Don't let the wolf win through your ignorance.","{""words"":42,""mentions"":[""Rin"",""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
